&lt;p&gt;大家好，我是基金会不知道几流反正不是一流和二流的写手&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brucewu0463&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5526785&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1610072239&quot; alt=&quot;BruceWu0463&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5526785)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brucewu0463&quot;  &gt;BruceWu0463&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;，目前是高三党。&lt;/p&gt;
